WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:02.710
<i>Previously on </i>Zombie Land Saga Revenge<i>,</i>

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:04.720
<i>we were set to open for Iron Frill!</i>

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.500
<i>As Franchouchou was trying to make a 
super strong impact, the leader of Iron Frill,</i>

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.980
<i>Shiori-san, shocked us by 
trying to headhunt Ai-chan!</i>

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.380
<i>No, no, no! If we say you can't 
have Ai-chan, then you can't!</i>

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.850
<i>Then, after we totally 
nailed our performance,</i>

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.980
<i>Shiorin decided to declare us their rivals?!</i>

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:19.450
<i>Okay, we'll take it!</i>

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:22.010
<i>Time to go, go, go down this road to revenge!</i>

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.510
Good morning, everyo—

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:34.360
Good morning!

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.430
G-Good morning?

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.930
Very good! I can see you all have 
your magical smiles ready today.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:46.310
Huh? There seems to be 
one exception, though!

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:49.030
G-Good m-morn...

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:50.480
I can't hear you!

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.020
Manners are fundamental, remember?

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.890
S-Sorry...

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:56.150
Huh? What... What is this?

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:58.830
What's the big idea?

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:03.530
Well, I was thinking about how I 
want to shine even brighter!

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:05.350
We got that job hosting a regular radio show,

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.160
the show at Saga Arena went great,

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.710
and Iron Frill declared us their rivals...

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:13.220
Everyone's been working super 
hard for their revenge, right?

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:15.370
So I wanna do that, too!

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:17.850
I thought if I could get a miracle 
power-up for my magicalness,

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:20.550
it'd be a wonderful 
level-up for Franchouchou!

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:23.840
That's a lot of spunk for a shrimp.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:28.820
I did notice Lily-han thinking 
a lot about something lately...

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:30.480
This must be it.

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:32.990
That's great, Lily-chan!

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:34.570
Do you have a specific plan?

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:35.810
You bet!

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:43.950
Japanese 
Got Performance

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.040
And boom!

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.640
For the first time ever, a member of 
Franchouchou won't be limited to local TV...

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:43.960
but will be appearing on 
a big national network!

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:45.980
N-National TV?!

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:48.060
Seriously?! That's nuts!

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.860
On <i>Japanese Got Performance</i>, anything goes!

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:55.050
It's a freestyle audition show!

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:59.750
If you manage to win at the regional 
preliminaries held all over the country...

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:03.760
you get to enter the 
national finals in Tokyo!

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:08.010
It's a wonderful chance for Franchouchou 
to make our big national debut!

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:12.400
TV is Lily-san's specialty, after all.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.260
I know you can win this, Lily-chan!

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:17.400
When's this show gonna be filming, anyway?

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:20.610
Right now!

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:28.350
Even if we have nothing else, 
we still have the future.

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:31.210
A lowest point? Starting over from 
zero? That's just part of the saga.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.960
Even if we burn out in the 
process, we'll make it come true!

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.870
This is where our revenge begins!

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:41.390
<b>{title}Zombie Land Saga 
Revenge</b>

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:46.680
<b>Little Bodda Bope SAGA</b>

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.500
<b>Saga City Cultural Hall</b>

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:04.510
<i>Pappy, I'm gonna be on national TV 
for the first time in a while...</i>

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:05.650
<i>Make sure to watch!</i>

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.810
We're gonna cheer for you with 
everything we've got, okay?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:14.440
Ai-chan, that's not how you hold towels 
in the cheering section. Like this!

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.310
I-Isn't this kind of overdoing it?

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.800
You can't get embarrassed, Ai-chan!

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.810
Next is how to swing these pen lights.

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:23.090
You wanna take both
 and spread them out like this...

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:24.950
Hold 'em tight so you don't drop them

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:27.270
Do you suppose she used to cheer for 
Ai-san like that when she was alive?

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.390
and make big arcs that 
are visible from stage!

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:29.880
It works great! I remember you 
saw me once thanks to these.

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.870
Ai-han was a lucky girl.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.050
Huh?

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:41.870
You gals are Franchouchou, right?

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:44.010
That was a hell of a show at Saga Arena.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:48.300
Thanks! I'm gonna put on a 
magical show again today.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.220
Excuse me!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.650
Could you clear the way? Thank you so much!

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.830
I'm Light Oozora!

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.860
Thank you all for looking after me today.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.650
Light Oozora?! The child actor prodigy?!

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:08.190
He's cute as a button!

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:10.090
Who the hell is Light?

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:13.230
I've seen him a bit here and there on TV.

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:17.430
He's an excellent actor. 
A bit like Lily-san before she died.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:21.120
Why would a famous child actor be 
in a regional competition in Saga?

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:25.130
Oh, are you all Franchouchou?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.260
You know us?

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:32.810
Yeah! You must be amazing if 
Iron Frill thinks of you as rivals.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:36.520
I was hoping I'd run into you if 
I came to Saga! This is great!

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:40.570
Are you all entering the contest?

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:43.260
Nope, it's just me today.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.630
Nice to meet you, Light-kun.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:47.900
Likewise, it's a pleasure!

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.760
What the hell is this, huh?

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:56.090
You seriously expect me to wait in 
the same green room as the peons?

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.210
I'm Light Oozora, damn it.

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:01.970
I am so sorry, Light-kun! 
I'm getting something ready, so...

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.540
You're should have it ready beforehand!

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:07.080
How long have you been my manager?

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.000
What the hell is this?

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:18.510
It literally says in my profile that I only 
eat the pudding roll cakes from Semplice!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.830
They don't have any locations in Saga...

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.880
Well, Saga sucks then, doesn't it?

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:29.230
That's part of why I bothered 
coming down here, though.

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:32.420
There's no way there are any decent 
performers out here in the sticks.

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:37.920
In other words, I've got a 100% shot 
at winning a ticket to the finals.

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:40.090
What about Franchouchou?

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:42.720
People have been talking about them 
lately, and one is in the contest...

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:44.140
Ishimura...

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:45.110
R-Right!

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:51.180
How long have you been 
watching me be legendary?

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:54.700
Franchouchou? Seriously?

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:56.960
My plan is perfect!

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:00.630
I'm gonna have the judges 
drowning in their own tears.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:02.630
U-Uh...

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:07.060
<i>Japanese Got Performance!</i>

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:11.250
We're here to see what diamonds in the 
rough are waiting to be found in Saga!

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:15.260
Here are our judges, 
who need no introduction!

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:22.210
Oh, crap! This is what national TV is like?!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:25.750
Big city TV is certainly glamorous.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.080
Light-kun said what?

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:31.800
Yeah! He seems to run really hot and cold!

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.340
And he's got some kind of plan!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:38.650
He said he came to Saga because 
he thought he could win for sure!

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:42.280
Really? Well, you don't need to worry!

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:44.300
I'm still just as wonderful.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:46.530
Sakura-chan, I'm counting on your cheers!

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:58.510
What's the holdup? You're the one 
who knows all this cheering stuff!

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.920
Sorry! We got kind of distracted...

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:04.470
Entry number 13, Kotaro Tatsumi-san!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.760
What kind of performance 
do you have for us today?

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.730
W-Well, I was going to do an impersonation.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:14.630
What's the impersonation of?

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:17.730
R-Right, th-this is... a mudskipper, 
during mating season.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.610
You can't do that on TV...

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.240
Lily has to go on next... after that?

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:42.570
Next is entry number 14, 
Franchouchou's Number Six!

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:46.410
Number Six!

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:46.410
Number Six!

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:57.650
I'd like to thank you all for 
taking the time to join us

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:59.550
all the way out here in Saga today.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.220
No matter how much the world changes, 
the ties that bind a family,

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:09.230
and the love they share for one another, 
always stay the same.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.060
Now, there was once a family...

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:14.930
That consisted of a skilled
craftsman named Kuma, his wife,

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:17.270
and their son Kamekichi...

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:20.020
"Now, now, don't worry about the change! 
Just keep it between you and me."

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:24.560
"But before, you were fit to be tied 
over that little bit of money!"

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:26.110
"I guess some things get better with age!"

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.680
"He didn't drink at all?"

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:32.120
"That's right! Pa is doing better now!"

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:36.830
"He's been working hard, and he 
keeps on asking about you, Ma!"

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:40.240
"I think he still... he must still...!"

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.630
"You're the nail that keeps this 
family together, sweetie."

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:43.070
"I'm a nail?

00:09:43.070 --> 00:09:47.150
That must explain why you let me have 
it with that hammer yesterday!"

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:54.460
Damn it... can't believe the 
shrimp's got me crying...

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.320
She really is a child actor prodigy.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:00.530
That was amazing, Number Six!

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.630
Oh, Light-kun! Good luck!

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:06.670
Thanks for warming the crowd up.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:10.860
We now have our final 
competitor for this round.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:15.450
You all recognize him! It's the 
famous child actor, Light Oozora!

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:17.080
Come on down!

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:35.110
Never give up!

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:46.010
You can do it...

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:48.160
Come on!

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.590
You can do it! You can do it!

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:50.810
You can do it!

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:54.140
Hang in there!

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:56.110
Steady as it goes...

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:57.970
You've got this! Come on!

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:02.170
You can do it! You can do it!

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:18.060
Never give up!

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.060
Never give up!

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:27.500
Bravo!

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:36.040
<i>Just as planned.</i>

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:42.970
I've got the results right here!

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:49.460
It looks like the finals will be between 
Light Oozora and Number Six of Franchouchou!

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:52.660
The showdown's coming up after the break!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:58.000
<b>Zombie Land Saga Revenge</b>

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:03.030
<b>Zombie Land Saga Revenge</b>

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:06.340
They're both gonna sing for the finals.

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:08.050
It's gotta be Light-kun taking it, right?

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:13.280
Man, it seems like everyone's convinced 
this Light kid's gonna win.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:15.710
Well, he created a lot of momentum.

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:17.750
Lily-chan...

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:22.420
<i>"Life."</i>

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:26.620
<i>A song I used to sing all 
the time with Pappy...</i>

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:30.750
<i>He said Mommy loved it, too.</i>

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:41.090
Can I help you with something?

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:44.350
I thought you did a great job.

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:46.370
But I'm not gonna give up either!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.030
I'm gonna sparkle and twinkle!

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:51.850
That space case act of yours?

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:54.950
Keep that up two years from now and 
people are just gonna think it's sad.

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.370
That goes for you, too, right?

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:59.360
I'm not like you!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:02.300
I'm gonna be on Broadway someday!

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.030
Broadway?

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:06.230
Surprised? I bet you are.

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:09.430
Most kid actors are only 
living in the moment.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:12.440
"So cute." "So little." "So lovable."

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:15.700
Nobody's gonna give a rat's ass about that 
stuff once we get out of elementary school.

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:20.280
We're getting older whether 
we like it or not!

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:24.370
That's where I'm different.

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:28.980
I'm gonna blow up bigger than everybody 
else and fly off to the next level!

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:34.250
Then I'm gonna make a new legend, 
one that only the adult me could pull off.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.470
Today's my first step towards that.

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:41.850
So keep up the cute act and enjoy the 
show when I blow you out of the water.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.120
Lily-chan... that's...

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:57.430
It's fine! I'm going to keep twinkling, 
no matter what!

00:13:57.430 --> 00:14:01.220
I'm gonna win big so Franchouchou 
can get their revenge!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:03.780
We're all with you!

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:07.410
I know you can do this, Lily-chan!

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:10.550
Yeah!

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:16.360
The performances in the 
preliminaries were amazing.

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:18.210
Now, I hear you have a song for us?

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:19.740
Is it going to be a nursery rhyme?

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:26.480
I'm going to sing...

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:30.050
"Life."

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:42.890
<i>A flower blooms so beautifully</i>

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:42.590
This song... it's...!

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:44.780
The song that Lily-san planned to sing!

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:52.660
<i>A blessing from the earth</i>

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:46.830
That's really bad, right?!

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:51.470
If she sings the same song right after him,
 it's going to seem like rehash.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.540
If it comes to that,
 I don't like her chances...

00:14:54.210 --> 00:15:05.290
<i>With the crystal clear rivers carrying joy</i>

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:15.700
<i>and peace to all around</i>

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:09.040
<i>What do I do? What should I do, Pappy?</i>

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:11.800
<i>Everyone... what do I do?</i>

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:14.530
We're all with you!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:27.950
<i>Letting go of all fear</i>

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:30.930
I'm gonna blow up bigger than everybody 
else and fly off to the next level!

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:37.870
<i>And having faith</i>

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:33.240
<i>I can do this.</i>

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:50.660
<i>With the words acting as a shield from harm</i>

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:51.020
<i>For the group!</i>

00:15:50.660 --> 00:16:01.550
<i>Let's sing the praises of life</i>

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:55.330
I can take flight, too!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.990
Seems things might already 
be settled here, folks...

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:24.870
Is this gonna be okay?
 We still have another finalist left...

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:58.780
<i>With the crystal clear rivers carrying joy!</i>

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.110
Is this... "Life"?

00:16:58.110 --> 00:16:59.520
She came up with an alternate arrangement?

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:04.330
<i>And peace to all around!</i>

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.510
Number Six!

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:10.260
Number Six!

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:00.770
That was great!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.470
Fantastic!

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:10.060
That was so perfect, it's hard to believe 
it was an improvised arrangement.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:13.230
What did you think when you found out 
you were both going for the same thing?

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:16.370
I remembered my friends in Franchouchou.

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:21.120
See, we've all been through a lot...

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:25.410
A lot of times we thought 
we couldn't keep going, too...

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:28.990
But none of us ever gave up!

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:32.420
So I knew I could go on, too!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:35.560
So that Franchouchou can 
be even more eternal,

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:39.330
I thought I had to fly high here!

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:47.110
Those were both incredible performances,

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:51.480
but the way this show works is 
we have to choose a winner.

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.710
And the winner today is...

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.910
the performer who showed potential

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:08.530
beyond what he's already 
accomplished as a child actor,

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:11.890
Light Oozora! You win!

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:15.800
Congratulations.

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:37.810
Light-kun? Where did you go?

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:41.560
It's almost time for our flight!

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:50.900
<i>I couldn't have pulled that off...</i>

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:55.700
<i>I lost. I might've been picked as 
the winner, but as a performer...?</i>

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:59.820
You should be proud, Light-kun.

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:04.270
Are you here to laugh at me?

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:07.710
You're the one who won the contest, y'know.

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:10.630
That means you did the better job.

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:12.300
That's how the business works.

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:15.620
Besides, you're gonna rise to 
the top on Broadway, right?

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:18.650
You can't let something 
like this stop you.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.570
Y'know this is the boys' bathroom, right?

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.620
It's fine. It's just me, after all.

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:32.300
Y'know, I'm always going to be twinkling.

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:34.240
That goes for everyone in Franchouchou.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:37.210
We're going to be twinkling stars forever!

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:43.170
That's why I decided to become a super 
twinkling star to help the others!

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:47.270
You've got something I could
 never have, Light-kun.

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:51.920
So... you should make that 
dream of yours come true.

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:01.490
You make it sound easy.

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:13.380
Drop by Tokyo sometime.

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:15.900
We can work on something together.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:17.320
See ya.

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:31.680
<b>I Danced Franchouchou Number Six's Scat</b>

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:35.810
<b>ILoveFranchouchou</b>

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:35.810
<b>Views</b>

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:40.800
<i>With the crystal clear rivers carrying joy!</i>

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:46.260
<i>And peace to all around!</i>

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:25.840
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:26.930
It's me, Lily!

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:29.750
I hope that we can make all 
our miracles come true!

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:33.290
I bet if we work hard enough, 
our future is going to twinkle for real!

00:23:33.290 --> 00:23:37.510
Next time on Episode 6 of <i>Zombie Land 
Saga Revenge</i>: "Walking Bet SAGA!"

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:40.050
<b>Episode 6: Walking Bet SAGA</b>

00:23:37.510 --> 00:23:38.320
Be sure to watch!
